			<table style="width: 100%">

<tr>
<th id="1">アカメ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S001.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S001.jpg" --></a><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S002.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="comment">四万十川で見られる、希少な巨大魚。<br />
<br />
「根付」と付くフィギュアの共通項として、「シルエットが丸っこい」というのがあります。<br />
本作も尻尾をくねらせることでシルエットを整え、さらに水しぶきが土台になるという素晴らしいデザイン。</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S003.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S003.jpg" --></a><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S004.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S004.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="comment">パーツは水しぶきで分割することで、違和感の無い分割になっています。</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S005.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S005_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S005.jpg" --></a><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S006.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S006_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S006.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="comment">３つとも食玩やカプセルフィギュアより一回り大きめで、満足感のあるサイズ。</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<th id="2">カワウソ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S007.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S007_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S007.jpg" --></a><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S008.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S008_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S008.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="comment">ウナギをつかまえるニホンカワウソ。<br />
黒目やヒゲも造型されており、墨入れが映えます。</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S009.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S009_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S009.jpg" --></a><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S010.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S010_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S010.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S011.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S011_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S011.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="comment">尻尾と水流の間に小さな穴があるので、ギリ根付として使えそうです。</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<th id="3">カッパ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S013.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S013.jpg" --></a><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S012.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S012_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S012.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="comment">相撲をとる２匹のかっぱ。<br />
踏ん張る様子が伝わってきます。</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S014.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S014.jpg" --></a><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S015.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S015.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S016.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S016.jpg" --></a><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S017.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S017.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="comment">大きいほうのカッパはワニガメのような甲羅。</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S018.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S018_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S018.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="comment">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="comment">松村さん造型の、四万十カッパフィギュアたち。</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><a href="img/netsukeWF2017S020.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/netsukeWF2017S020_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/netsuke/WF2017s/img/netsukeWF2017S020.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="comment">
いずれこのカッパも塗装してあげたい。</td>
</tr>

